    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an air fryer to 390 degrees F (200 degrees C) for 15 minutes according to manufacturer’s instructions.",
